  allLines:
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dc24e77c8220d5b43bd418e911809b3b, type: 3}
    sentence: "I\u2019m curious, how is it that you ended up livingin Mars? I thought
      Neptunians and Marsians were polar opposites."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Nemelise
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b5a5cc5d83848d843aadeaf9b5e083f1, type: 3}
    sentence: Ah well. I was born and raised in Neptune originally and then I got
      accepted into a prestigious college in Mars. Interestingly so, they are home
      to some of the best performance schools in the galaxy.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Nemelise
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "It broke me when I first arrived, I wasn\u2019t accepted as who I
      was. Everyone told me I was supposed to be the opposite of what I believed
      to be my best attributes."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: 'Gender norms. Mars is surprisingly backwards about that sort of thing.

'
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Nemelise
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "Yeah, but I came out on top at the end. It destroyed me at first,
      but then I rebuilt myself to be even stronger. I used to see it as a curse,
      but now it\u2019s become a blessing."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Linus
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: 
    eventTrigger: 
    choices:
    - choices: "You\u2019ve created something beautiful for new generations to look
        up to."
      nextScenario: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a72183cb46e8a224b87da0612c895ba3, type: 2}
